Pi Bot Media Desk Plugin
========================

This plugin adapts workflow prompts, style extraction rules, style presets, and
review heuristics from `dsh-media-desk`:

- Upstream project: https://github.com/woniuniuniu/dsh-media-desk
- Upstream commit:  d51464345705489b942bdcec242375ee3930c2b6
- Author:           woniuniuniu (蜗牛的科技笔记)
- License:          MIT License (see LICENSE in this directory)

Adapted source files:
- `src/produce.js`       -> staged planning, drafting, asset prompt framing, and surgical revision rules
- `src/ai.js`            -> planning brief schema, voiceover script vs. article format rules, voice fidelity rubric
- `src/images.js`        -> cover, editorial illustration, and B&W pencil storyboard prompt frames (without external HTTP API keys)
- `src/style.js`         -> writing-style card extraction schema and prompt formatting
- `src/style-presets.js` -> 15 bilingual creator style presets across 8 content categories
- `src/intents.js`       -> natural-language workflow commands (idea capture, drafting, scheduling, status)
- `src/learn.js`         -> performance & edit-diff review heuristics for proposing durable writing rules

Intentionally omitted:
- Monid CLI integration and external social-account scraping/import
- Direct third-party image API key management and HTTP image gateways (replaced with Pi Bot's built-in image/video generation capabilities)
